# =============================================================================
# opendata.swiss (ODSn) — RDF metadata model, as an example instance graph
# =============================================================================
#
# Purpose
#   A single, connected, realistic example of every resource type that the
#   opendata.swiss piveau installation stores in its triplestore. Load it into
#   SPEX (https://spex.zazuko.com) — or any RDF tool — to see the classes, the
#   properties, and how they link to each other.
#
#   This is INSTANCE data, not a schema. Every class in the model is present at
#   least once, and every property that the ODSn profile allows is used at least
#   once, so that a structural analysis of this file reproduces the full model.
#
# What it covers
#   - Core DCAT-AP CH: Catalog, CatalogRecord, Dataset, Distribution,
#     DataService, Agent, contact points, Location, PeriodOfTime, Checksum,
#     LicenseDocument, Relationship, Attribution
#   - Organizations: the org: hierarchy used by the hub and the search index
#   - Showcases: the ODSn-only resource type, as stored after import
#
#   Native piveau structures and ODSn/ETL modifications are shown together as
#   one model — this is the state of the data AFTER the pipelines have run.
#   Where a value only exists because of an ODSn pipe module or a harvester
#   transformation, an inline comment says so.
#
# Derived from
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_profile/dcat-ap-ch.hub.shapes.ttl
#       (ODSn fork of piveau-indexing dcat-ap.shapes.ttl @ 8ab8d108, DCAT-AP 2.1.1)
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_profile/organization.ttl
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_profile/showcase.hub.shapes.ttl
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_profile/piveau.json
#   - opendata.swiss/piveau_modules/piveau-consus-filter        (license/identifier/spatial normalisation)
#   - opendata.swiss/piveau_modules/piveau-consus-patching      (showcase de-cloaking, reference unwrapping)
#   - opendata.swiss/piveau_modules/piveau-consus-importing-showcases
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_scripts/geocat-transform.js (CSW → DCAT)
#   - opendata.swiss/metadata/piveau_systemtests/src/test/resources/*.ttl
#   - opendata.swiss/docs/systemarchitektur-piveau.md
#   - upstream https://gitlab.com/piveau/utilities/piveau-indexing (dcat-ap.shapes.ttl)
#
# Storage layout (not expressible in a single Turtle file, noted here instead)
#   piveau-hub-repo stores each dataset in its own named graph whose IRI equals
#   the dataset IRI, e.g. GRAPH <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/{id}>.
#   Catalogues, organizations and vocabularies live in their own graphs.
#   Base URI of the installation: https://opendata.swiss/
#
# Out of scope here (deliberately)
#   Controlled vocabularies (EU/ODSn SKOS concept schemes) and the DQV quality
#   measurements written back by the `metrics` system pipe. Vocabulary concepts
#   appear below only as stubs, so that property ranges are visible.
#
# Verified against production (REF)
#   Cross-checked on 2026-08-12 against the live SPARQL endpoint
#   https://trifid.ref.ods.zazukoians.org/query — all IRI patterns, classes and
#   per-class predicates below reflect what that instance actually stores.
#   Properties that the SHACL profile ALLOWS but that no resource in REF
#   currently USES are kept as commented-out triples, so the file stays an
#   accurate picture of the data while still documenting the full profile.
#   Note: harvested pass-through triples that are outside the profile (e.g.
#   rdfs:seeAlso, owl:versionInfo, schema:diagram on datasets) also exist in
#   production; they are noise, not model, and are not reproduced here.
# =============================================================================

@prefix adms:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#> .
@prefix dcat:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcatap: <http://data.europa.eu/r5r/> .
@prefix dct:    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix foaf:   <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix locn:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#> .
@prefix org:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .
@prefix prov:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix pv:     <https://piveau.eu/ns/voc#> .
@prefix rdfs:   <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix schema: <http://schema.org/> .
@prefix skos:   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix spdx:   <http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#> .
@prefix time:   <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .
@prefix vcard:  <http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#> .
@prefix xsd:    <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# The showcase class IRI is literally https://example.org/Showcase in the
# production profile (piveau_profile/piveau.json → resources[].typeUri).
@prefix ex:     <https://example.org/> .


# =============================================================================
# 1. CATALOGUE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# One catalogue per harvester. Catalogue metadata is versioned in the repository
# under metadata/piveau_catalogues/ and generated by the `meta_harvester` tool
# from the legacy CKAN instance.
# =============================================================================

<https://opendata.swiss/id/catalogue/bfs-dcat-harvester>
    a                    dcat:Catalog ;

    # --- mandatory (DCAT-AP CH) -------------------------------------------
    dct:title            "Bundesamt für Statistik BFS"@de ,
                         "Office fédéral de la statistique OFS"@fr ,
                         "Ufficio federale di statistica UST"@it ,
                         "Federal Statistical Office FSO"@en ;
    dct:description      "Das BFS ist das nationale Kompetenzzentrum der öffentlichen Statistik der Schweiz."@de ,
                         "L'OFS est le centre de compétence de la statistique publique suisse."@fr ,
                         "L'UST è il centro di competenza nazionale per la statistica pubblica della Svizzera."@it ,
                         "The FSO is Switzerland's national competence centre for official statistics."@en ;
    # Points at an org:Organization, not a bare foaf:Agent — an ODSn convention
    # so that the search index can resolve the organization hierarchy.
    dct:publisher        <https://opendata.swiss/id/organization/bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;

    # --- recommended / optional -------------------------------------------
    dct:language         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/DEU> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/FRA> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ITA> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG> ;
    dct:spatial          <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CHE> ;
    # dct:created is written by meta_harvester alongside issued/modified.
    dct:created          "2018-02-02T10:14:39.450482"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:issued           "2018-02-02T10:14:39.450482"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:modified         "2026-01-29T09:15:46.038610"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    # dct:type carries the harvester kind; written by `meta_harvester`.
    dct:type             "ckan"^^xsd:string ;
    foaf:homepage        <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/> ;

    dcat:dataset         <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ,
                         <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/waldbestand-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dcat:service         <https://opendata.swiss/set/data-service/stats-swiss-sdmx> ;
    dcat:record          <https://opendata.swiss/set/record/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> .

    # Allowed by the profile but not used by any catalogue in production:
    #   dct:license, dct:rights, dcat:themeTaxonomy, dct:creator,
    #   dct:hasPart / dct:isPartOf / dcat:catalog (no catalogue nesting exists;
    #   the ~148 harvester catalogues are flat siblings).


# The showcases catalogue: showcases are configured as an in-catalogue custom
# resource type (piveau.json → resources[0].inCatalogue = true). The hub links
# catalogue → showcase with BOTH dcat:resource and pv:resource (verified in
# production; the catalogue slug there is `showcases-ods`).
<https://opendata.swiss/id/catalogue/showcases-ods>
    a                    dcat:Catalog ;
    dct:title            "Showcases"@de , "Showcases"@fr , "Showcases"@it , "Showcases"@en ;
    dct:description      "Anwendungen und Auswertungen, die auf offenen Behördendaten basieren."@de ;
    dct:publisher        <https://opendata.swiss/id/organization/ch1> ;
    dcat:resource        <https://opendata.swiss/set/resource/showcase/mietpreisentwicklung-in-bern> ;
    pv:resource          <https://opendata.swiss/set/resource/showcase/mietpreisentwicklung-in-bern> .


# =============================================================================
# 2. CATALOG RECORD
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provenance envelope minted by piveau-hub-repo for every resource it stores.
# It records when the hub saw the resource, which is distinct from the
# dct:issued / dct:modified of the dataset itself.
#
# Verified against production: record IRIs are …/set/record/{id}, where {id} is
# the dataset slug or a UUID. The hub writes exactly the properties below —
# including the piveau-internal pv:originalId / pv:originalURIRef (the id and
# IRI the resource had in the source system before the hub re-minted it) and an
# MD5 checksum of the stored payload used for change detection. The shape's
# dct:conformsTo / dct:source / dct:language / dct:title / dct:description /
# adms:status are allowed but never populated in production.
# =============================================================================

<https://opendata.swiss/set/record/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs>
    a                    dcat:CatalogRecord ;
    foaf:primaryTopic    <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dct:identifier       "arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs" ;
    dct:issued           "2026-04-28T09:12:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:modified         "2026-04-28T09:12:03Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    # Always the literal IRI http://piveau.io in production.
    dct:creator          <http://piveau.io> ;
    pv:originalId        "36503351@bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs" ;
    pv:originalURIRef    <https://dam-api.bfs.admin.ch/hub/api/ogd/harvest#36503351> ;
    spdx:checksum        _:checksumRecord .

_:checksumRecord
    a                    spdx:Checksum ;
    spdx:algorithm       <http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_md5> ;
    spdx:checksumValue   "fc049e74a2abd4e97c690a36f4a0e84a"^^xsd:hexBinary .


# =============================================================================
# 3. DATASET — full example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything DCAT-AP CH allows on a dcat:Dataset in the ODSn profile, plus the
# ODSn-only property schema:image.
#
# Note: piveau-consus-filter also lets dcat:DatasetSeries through the pipe (it
# accepts exactly one of dcat:Dataset / dcat:DatasetSeries / dcat:DataService
# per payload), but the ODSn SHACL profile defines no shape for it, so no
# series example is modelled here.
# =============================================================================

<https://opendata.swiss/set/data/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs>
    a                    dcat:Dataset ;

    # --- mandatory --------------------------------------------------------
    # Identifier convention enforced by piveau-consus-filter:
    #   [Source-Dataset-ID]@[Source-Organisation-ID]
    # where the org part is the opendata.swiss organization slug. A dataset
    # with a missing, multiple or malformed identifier is rejected by the pipe.
    dct:identifier       "36503351@bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs" ;
    dct:title            "Arbeitswegzeit und Arbeitswegdistanz"@de ,
                         "Durée et longueur du trajet des pendulaires"@fr ,
                         "Durata e lunghezza del tragitto casa-lavoro"@it ,
                         "Commuting time and distance"@en ;
    dct:description      "Dieses Dataset präsentiert die jährlichen Zahlen der Statistik der Schweizer Städte 2026."@de ,
                         "Ce dataset présente les chiffres annuels des Statistiques des villes suisses 2026."@fr ,
                         "Questo set di dati presenta le cifre annuali della Statistica delle città svizzere 2026."@it ,
                         "This dataset presents the annual figures of the Statistics on Swiss Cities and Towns 2026."@en ;
    dct:publisher        <https://opendata.swiss/id/organization/bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dcat:contactPoint    _:contactPointBfsOrg , _:contactPointBfsIndividual ;

    # --- recommended ------------------------------------------------------
    dcat:distribution    <https://opendata.swiss/set/distribution/36503367-de-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ,
                         <https://opendata.swiss/set/distribution/link-36503376-de-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dcat:keyword         "arbeitsweg"@de , "pendler"@de ,
                         "pendulaires"@fr ,
                         "pendolari"@it ,
                         "commuting"@en ;
    dcat:landingPage     <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/asset/de/DF_SSV_LABMAR_08> ;
    dcat:theme           <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/TRAN> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/SOCI> ;
    dct:issued           "2026-04-28T07:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:modified         "2026-04-28T07:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    # piveau-consus-filter drops dct:spatial values that are plain literals
    # (legacy CKAN wrote e.g. "Politische Gemeinden"); only IRIs and
    # dct:Location nodes survive the pipe.
    dct:spatial          <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CHE> ,
                         _:locationBern ;
    dct:temporal         _:periodOfTime2023 ;

    # --- optional ---------------------------------------------------------
    dct:accessRights     <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC> ;
    dct:accrualPeriodicity <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/frequency/ANNUAL> ;
    # Validated by piveau-consus-filter: must be an IRI, otherwise the dataset
    # is not imported.
    dct:conformsTo       <https://dcat-ap.ch/releases/2.0/dcat-ap-ch.html> ;
    dct:language         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/DEU> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/FRA> ;
    dct:relation         <https://www.admin.ch/opc/de/classified-compilation/19920252/index.html> ;
    dct:isReferencedBy   <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/waldbestand-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    foaf:page            <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/asset/de/DF_SSV_LABMAR_08/about> ;
    # Shape-allowed; no dataset in production currently carries a
    # prov:qualifiedAttribution (dcat:qualifiedRelation does occur).
    prov:qualifiedAttribution _:attributionBfs ;
    dcat:qualifiedRelation    _:relationshipOriginal ;

    # --- ODSn extension ---------------------------------------------------
    # schema:image is not part of upstream piveau's Dataset shape; added for
    # opendata.swiss so the UI can show a teaser image.
    schema:image         <https://opendata.swiss/images/logo_horizontal.png> .


# --- Contact points ---------------------------------------------------------
# vcard:Kind subclasses; both Organization and Individual occur in production.

_:contactPointBfsOrg
    a                    vcard:Organization ;
    vcard:fn             "Auskunftsdienst BFS" ;
    vcard:hasEmail       <mailto:auskunftsdienst@bfs.admin.ch> ;
    vcard:hasURL         <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/kontakt> ;
    vcard:hasTelephone   <tel:+41584631111> .

_:contactPointBfsIndividual
    a                    vcard:Individual ;
    vcard:fn             "Sekretariat Statistik" ;
    vcard:hasEmail       <mailto:info@bfs.admin.ch> .


# --- Qualified attribution (prov) -------------------------------------------

_:attributionBfs
    a                    prov:Attribution ;
    dcat:hadRole         <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/pointOfContact> ;
    prov:agent           _:agentBfsSection .

# The generic Agent shape (foaf:Agent) applies here: foaf:name is mandatory,
# dct:type optional. Publishers on catalogues and datasets are the more
# specific org:Organization instead — an ODSn convention, see section 7.
_:agentBfsSection
    a                    foaf:Agent , foaf:Organization ;
    foaf:name            "Sektion Mobilität BFS" ;
    dct:type             <http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority> ;
    foaf:homepage        <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/mobilitaet> ;
    foaf:mbox            <mailto:mobilitaet@bfs.admin.ch> .


# --- Qualified relation (dcat) ----------------------------------------------

_:relationshipOriginal
    a                    dcat:Relationship ;
    dct:relation         <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/waldbestand-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dcat:hadRole         <http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/original> .


# --- Temporal coverage ------------------------------------------------------
# The profile's PeriodOfTime shape accepts dcat:startDate/dcat:endDate and the
# OWL-Time properties. Some source systems deliver schema:startDate instead;
# both reach the triplestore.

_:periodOfTime2023
    a                    dct:PeriodOfTime ;
    dcat:startDate       "2023-01-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dcat:endDate         "2023-12-31"^^xsd:date ;
    time:hasBeginning    _:instant2023Start ;
    time:hasEnd          _:instant2023End .

_:instant2023Start  a time:Instant ; time:inXSDDate "2023-01-01"^^xsd:date .
_:instant2023End    a time:Instant ; time:inXSDDate "2023-12-31"^^xsd:date .


# --- Spatial coverage -------------------------------------------------------
# Produced by the geocat.ch / CSW harvesting path: geocat-transform.js turns the
# ows:BoundingBox of a CSW record into a GeoJSON polygon on locn:geometry.
# The datatype IRI is written by the transform as https://replacement.io/... and
# rewritten to the IANA namespace by piveau before storage.

_:locationBern
    a                    dct:Location ;
    locn:geometry        "{\"type\": \"Polygon\", \"coordinates\": [[[7.29,46.87],[7.72,46.87],[7.72,47.05],[7.29,47.05],[7.29,46.87]]]}"^^<https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/vnd.geo+json> ;
    dcat:bbox            "POLYGON((7.29 46.87, 7.72 46.87, 7.72 47.05, 7.29 47.05, 7.29 46.87))"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> ;
    dcat:centroid        "POINT(7.50 46.96)"^^<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral> ;
    skos:prefLabel       "Kanton Bern"@de .


# =============================================================================
# 4. DISTRIBUTION
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Two distributions: a downloadable CSV (checksum, byte size, package format)
# and an access-only HTML view that resolves to a DataService.
# =============================================================================

<https://opendata.swiss/set/distribution/36503367-de-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs>
    a                    dcat:Distribution ;

    # --- mandatory --------------------------------------------------------
    dcat:accessURL       <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/asset/de/DF_SSV_LABMAR_08> ;
    # piveau-consus-filter requires dct:license on EVERY distribution, requires
    # it to be one of the four dcat-ap.ch "Terms of use" IRIs, and requires all
    # distributions of a dataset to carry the SAME value. Legacy CKAN strings
    # such as "NonCommercialAllowed-CommercialAllowed-ReferenceRequired" are
    # rewritten to the matching IRI by the pipe.
    dct:license          <http://dcat-ap.ch/vocabulary/licenses/terms_by_ask> ;

    # --- recommended / optional -------------------------------------------
    dct:title            "Arbeitswegzeit und Arbeitswegdistanz (CSV)"@de ,
                         "Durée et longueur du trajet des pendulaires (CSV)"@fr ;
    dct:description      "Jahreswerte als kommaseparierte Datei."@de ;
    dct:format           <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/file-type/CSV> ;
    dcat:mediaType       <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/csv> ;
    dcat:packageFormat   <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/zip> ;
    dcat:downloadURL     <https://dam-api.bfs.admin.ch/hub/api/dam/assets/36503367/master.csv> ;
    dcat:byteSize        646458 ;
    dct:issued           "2026-04-28T07:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:modified         "2026-04-28T07:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:language         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/DEU> ,
                         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/FRA> ;
    dct:rights           <https://opendata.swiss/id/rights/bfs-terms> ;
    dct:conformsTo       <https://dcat-ap.ch/releases/2.0/dcat-ap-ch.html> ;
    dcat:temporalResolution "P1Y"^^xsd:duration ;
    dcatap:availability  <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/planned-availability/AVAILABLE> ;
    foaf:page            <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/asset/de/DF_SSV_LABMAR_08/about> ;
    spdx:checksum        _:checksumCsv ;

    # --- ODSn extensions --------------------------------------------------
    # dct:identifier, dct:coverage and schema:image are not in upstream
    # piveau's Distribution shape; added for opendata.swiss. In production,
    # identifier (~26k) and coverage (~94) occur; schema:image does not (yet).
    dct:identifier       "36503367-de@bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs" ;
    dct:coverage         "2023" ;
    schema:image         <https://opendata.swiss/images/logo_default.png> .


<https://opendata.swiss/set/distribution/link-36503376-de-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs>
    a                    dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL       <https://stats.swiss/vis?lc=de&dfds=disseminate&dfid=DF_SSV_LABMAR_08> ;
    dct:license          <http://dcat-ap.ch/vocabulary/licenses/terms_by_ask> ;
    dct:title            "Daten im Browser anschauen"@de ;
    dct:language         <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/DEU> ;
    dcat:mediaType       <https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/text/html> ;
    dct:issued           "2026-04-28T07:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dct:identifier       "link-36503376-de@bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs" ;
    # Links a distribution to the service that delivers it.
    dcat:accessService   <https://opendata.swiss/set/data-service/stats-swiss-sdmx> .


_:checksumCsv
    a                    spdx:Checksum ;
    spdx:algorithm       <http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#checksumAlgorithm_sha1> ;
    spdx:checksumValue   "5bcc814127be171c75595d419f371c74c9cf0414"^^xsd:hexBinary .


# =============================================================================
# 5. DATA SERVICE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ODSn adds dct:publisher, dcat:keyword and dcat:landingPage to piveau's
# DataService shape; the HVD/legislation/availability properties of upstream
# DCAT-AP 2.1.1 are switched off because DCAT-AP CH 2.0 does not define them.
# Production holds 3 data services; their predicates match this example
# (some additionally carry pass-through dct:type / dcat:theme).
# =============================================================================

<https://opendata.swiss/set/data-service/stats-swiss-sdmx>
    a                    dcat:DataService ;
    dct:title            "STATS.swiss SDMX API"@de , "STATS.swiss SDMX API"@en ;
    dct:description      "SDMX-REST-Schnittstelle auf die Datenwürfel des BFS."@de ,
                         "SDMX REST interface to the FSO data cubes."@en ;
    dcat:endpointURL     <https://stats.swiss/rest> ;
    dcat:endpointDescription <https://stats.swiss/rest/openapi.json> ;
    dcat:servesDataset   <https://opendata.swiss/set/data/arbeitswegzeit-und-arbeitswegdistanz-bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dct:license          <http://dcat-ap.ch/vocabulary/licenses/terms_by_ask> ;
    dct:accessRights     <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC> ;
    dcat:contactPoint    _:contactPointBfsOrg ;
    foaf:page            <https://www.bfs.admin.ch/stats-swiss/api> ;

    # --- ODSn extensions --------------------------------------------------
    dct:publisher        <https://opendata.swiss/id/organization/bundesamt-fur-statistik-bfs> ;
    dcat:keyword         "sdmx"@de , "api"@de ;
    dcat:landingPage     <https://stats.swiss/> .


# =============================================================================
# 6. SECOND DATASET — geocat.ch / CSW path
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Minimal shape of what piveau-consus-importing-csw plus geocat-transform.js
# produce: title/description/keywords in the record language, a bounding-box
# Location, and one distribution carrying the source identifier and format.
# =============================================================================

